# S08: S07's room in the `leaves` x-ray: each visible point coloured by its BSP leaf. The
# pan continues S07's at 4 degrees a second: the file's second 1.0 is the frame after the
# last one of S07 the film shows. Classic at 320x200.

map e1m1

duration 4
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 320x200
hud off
cvar gamma 0.7

camera path
key 0  -208,2736,192  20,207.8667  ease linear
key 4  -208,2736,192  20,191.8667

xray leaves

events on
